  "body": "Tucked privately at the end of a driveway in a quiet, sun-drenched setting, this spacious Lockwood-style sanctuary delivers warmth, light, and effortless living in the heart of Takapuna. Vendor instructions are clear—their circumstances have changed and this MUST sell!\r\n\r\nWhy You’ll Love It:\r\n\r\n• Sunlit Living & Flow: Open-plan kitchen and spacious living room open seamlessly to a north-facing deck and charming cottage garden with visiting Tuis — perfect for your morning coffee, afternoon relaxing or outdoor entertaining.\r\n• Smart & Practical Layout: Two generous double bedrooms (master with private dressing room and ensuite), family bathroom, separate toilet, and dedicated laundry.\r\n• Low Maintenance: Flat section, covered carport, garden shed, and scope to update and add value over time.\r\n•  Unbeatable Location: Minutes to Takapuna Beach, vibrant local cafés, dining, shopping, North Shore Hospital is in easy reach and fast city motorway access. Ideal for the busy first homebuyers, healthcare professionals or active downsizers!\r\n•  Elite School Zones: In-zone for Westlake Boys, Westlake Girls, Takapuna Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, and Takapuna Grammar.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are serious, this home will be sold, don’t miss your opportunity.\r\n\r\nCome to the open homes this weekend or contact me today to arrange your viewing.",
